@{ ViewData["Title"] = L["[[organisation]] onboarding"].Value; }
<h1>@L["[[organisation]] onboarding"]</h1>
<div class="error-summary" role="alert" tabindex="-1">
    <h2>@L["You cannot change this [[organisation|lower]]'s configuration"]</h2>
    <p>@L["Onboarding changes [[organisation|lower]]-level configuration. Your roles let you open onboarding, but the configuration rights it needs are held by [[organisation]] Administrators and Business Configuration Administrators. A Tenant Administrator's configuration rights cover tenant-level definitions only."]</p>
    <p>@L["Ask [[organisation|a]] Administrator to do this, or grant yourself that role in user administration (this is audited)."]</p>
</div>
